  "details": "<p>Thomas Ashby notes this place as the findspot of at least two inscriptions,\u00a0<em>CIL\u00a0</em>14, 3923 and one other that he indicates was unpublished.\u00a0<em>CIL\u00a0</em>14, 3922 might also have come from the vicinity of this place, according to Ashby.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The Casale Sinibalda is located on the western side of the Fosso Saina. Located to the north of the casale are the remains of a basis villae of the so-called fourth style, meaning it verges on opus quadratum.",
